  "ruleText": "Agr 903.05 Ungraded Honey. Packages of ungraded honey may be offered for sale or distribution provided that the label uses either the term \"ungraded\" or the term \"not graded.\"\n\nSource. #6977, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
